@* Shared by Product/EditProduct and Downloads/Index (#1550): one wording for the Windows agent install hint. *@
@using HSMServer.Model.Agent
<p class="text-muted small">Download a ready-to-run Windows agent pre-configured for the selected product — this server's address and an access key are baked into its <code>config.json</code>. Run <code>@AgentInstallerBundle.InstallScript</code> as Administrator on the target machine; the agent self-installs as an auto-start Windows service and connects. For uninstall, logs and updates, see <code>@AgentInstallerBundle.ReadmeName</code> in the archive.</p>
